BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Write to the Mic Dodge Poetry Teen Workshops
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260819T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260819T190000
UID:51c0d1ee244ab8cb242e9e918b75f706@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Everyone’s voice is different. We want to hear&nbsp\; yours 
 . This winter/spring\, come together with other teens (ages 13 to 18) from
  across Newark at a &nbsp\;Dodge Poetry workshop &nbsp\;designed to showca
 se your words and ideas. Poets from the community ( like &nbsp\; Newark’
 s first-ever poet laureate\, Mia X )\, and students from the&nbsp\; Rutger
 s-Newark MFA program in Poetry \, will be on hand to offer prompts\, sugge
 stions and ideas. But the focus is on you: &nbsp\;What frustrates you? Whe
 re do you find joy? What does this city and this country look like from yo
 ur unique\, powerful perspective? We believe poetry can be found in books\
 , but also in hip hop\, at protests and parties\, in the clip of a song pl
 aying from the window of a passing car.&nbsp\; Poetry is an oral tradition
  \, especially here in Newark. (Even our&nbsp\; mayor&nbsp\; is a spoken w
 ord artist\; this is what we do!) So be a part of the conversation. Join u
 s to write your own verses\, and then (if you choose) speak them out loud 
 at the&nbsp\; open mic that ends every session . Workshops are FREE &nbsp\
 ;and will be held in person on the first Wednesday of the month (at locati
 ons in various wards in Newark\; see below for details) and virtually on t
 he third Wednesday of the month. THEME: Youth Poetry Workshop (Ages 13-18)
  / Open Mic HOST: NJPAC FEATURES: Poets from the community ( like &nbsp\; 
 Newark’s first-ever poet laureate\, Mia X )\, and students from the&nbsp
 \; Rutgers-Newark MFA program in Poetry \, will be on hand to offer prompt
 s\, suggestions and ideas. PRICE: FREE RSVP - https://www.njpac.org/event/
 write-to-the-mic-dodge-poetry-teen-workshops/#rsvp CONTACT: IG - @njpac / 
 FB - NJPAC
LOCATION:Zoom\, NJ
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/write-to-the-mic-dodge-poetry-
 teen-workshops-8-19
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
END:VEVENT
