DESCRIPTION:@mochamicwithmillie Mocha Mic with Millie is Back &amp\; Augus
 t Awaits! I can’t wait to share space with you on Friday\, August 21st f
 rom 6:30–9:30 PM. Join us for a beautiful summer evening of poetry\, mus
 ic\, and genuine connection at the outdoor space of @bowlburgerbistro. The
 re is truly nothing like gathering in community. Supported with funds by @
 jerseycityartscouncil We’re excited to welcome four incredible featured 
 artists: SJ ( @sjbythegram ) is a Jersey City sound poet known for his int
 eractive performances and dedication to the local poetry community. Just-A
 ce ( @iam_justace ) blends spoken word and hip hop to explore identity\, f
 amily\, faith\, and resilience. Sonia Mukherji ( @soniamukherji ) is an in
 ternationally published poet whose work explores identity\, politics\, and
  the South Asian experience. Siena Milan ( @sienamilan ) is a Neo Soul sin
 ger-songwriter whose rich vocals and heartfelt storytelling create moments
  of comfort and reflection. Friday\, August 15 6:30–9:30 PM @bowlburgerb
 istro 531 West Side Ave\, Jersey City\, NJ 07304 @nakeiaisthename Expressi
 ons by MowZus $20 Attendees | $15 Performers Ticket link in bio &amp\; on 
 Eventbrite - https://www.eventbrite.com/e/mocha-mic-with-millie-8212026-ti
 ckets-1994632370113 1 entrée minimum + 1 drink minimum No alcohol served.
  Mocktails and specials available. Whether you’re coming to perform\, li
 sten\, or simply be in community\, there is a place for you here. I truly 
 can’t wait to share another beautiful night with the Tribe of Scribes &a
 mp\; Good Vibes. THEME: OPEN MIC / FEATURES HOST: Millicent Ansah FEATURES
