DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260918T220000
UID:a14c46837c7623e1e186f39c977644ed@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Name of Event: Let It Flow at the House of Playokee Date: Sept
 ember 18\, 2026 Start/End Time: 6:30 pm Address: 1050 Stuyvesant Ave\, Uni
 on\, NJ Theme: Open Mic and feature Host: Elijah Brown Feature(s): TBA Pri
 ce: $10 Phone: TEXT (862) 306-1758 Email Address: &nbsp\; lifpublishing@gm
 ail.com Website: Social Media: &nbsp\; @elijahbr85 Event Description: &nbs
 p\;&nbsp\;LET IT FLOW at the House of Playokee The House of Playokee is mo
 re than a venue. It’s a creative home. A space rooted in culture\, art\,
  and community. It’s a place where voices are protected\, stories are ho
 nored\, and artists are treated with care. Add to that a full menu that ke
 eps people coming back\, and you understand why this room feels different.
  From flavorful comfort food to vegan friendly options\, the House of Play
 okee serves real meals\, not bar snacks. Your words are fed and so is your
  body. Plus it’s BYOB when you purchase a pitcher. Hosted by Elijah M. B
 rown\, Let It Flow continues to be a trusted space where truth leads and v
 ulnerability is respected. With over 20 years of creating platforms for ar
 tists\, Elijah brings intention to the mic and makes sure the room stays w
 elcoming for first timers and seasoned performers alike. Come hungry for w
 ords. Leave full in every way. Let it flow.
LOCATION:House of Playokee\, 1050 Stuyvesant Ave\, Union NJ\, Union\, NJ
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/letitflow-open-mic-sept
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
END:VEVENT
